source, wordlists, firmware, DSP coefficient files, or proprietary blobs.
Each tool remains under the license recorded in docs/offensive/manual.md,
at the upstream URL in that entry.

Impacket is a modified Apache-2.0 project. Its NOTICE lives upstream at
https://github.com/fortra/impacket . This package does not copy that
NOTICE, because it does not distribute Impacket.

Other upstream notices, modified grants, and non-OSI licenses are listed
in the "License and third-party notices" section of the manual. Fedora,
COPR, and upstream packages installed separately are separate works.
Their licenses stay with those packages.

Redistributors of raccoonix-t2 keep this NOTICE and LICENSE-Apache-2.0
with the distribution. That is the attribution requirement in Apache-2.0
